        "attributes" : {
          "name" : "Vigilance",
          "description" : "<p>Play defensively with the ability to heal damage, remove dangerous units from play, and protect your base from enemy attacks. This aspect is perfect for players who like patient playstyles that can endure even the deadliest assaults. &nbsp;</p>",
