          "name" : "Heroism",
          "description" : "<p>Fight for peace and justice with cards that feature the protagonists of the <i>Star Wars</i> series. This aspect is great for players who want their cards to support and protect each other while pressing the attack. This aspect is often paired with another aspect on a card.&nbsp;</p>",
          "color" : "#ffffff",
